WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:04.500
- [Narrator] Tokyo is a city
that needs no introduction.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:09.253
In Japan's capital, modernity
and history live side by side.

00:00:11.225 --> 00:00:12.964
(upbeat music)

00:00:12.964 --> 00:00:15.980
And when it comes to street
food, it's no different,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.700
with recipes passed down
through generations,

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.233
the flavors here can transcend time.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.120
We begin with a snack that uses an often

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.273
overlooked ingredient
in street food: octopus.

00:00:29.647 --> 00:00:32.230
(lively music)

00:01:26.418 --> 00:01:27.650
- [Narrator] Next up, a dish that has

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:29.983
taken decades for one man to perfect.

00:01:31.762 --> 00:01:34.345
(upbeat music)

00:02:28.807 --> 00:02:30.910
- [Narrator] Gyoza may not be Japanese,

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:34.073
but we found an amazing
shop that we had to share.

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:37.537
(lively music)

00:03:31.513 --> 00:03:32.977
- [Narrator] Originally from Hiroshima,

00:03:32.977 --> 00:03:36.285
this next dish has
become a staple in Tokyo.

00:03:36.285 --> 00:03:38.868
(upbeat music)

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.530
- [Narrator] Finally, we
end with something sweet

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:40.165
at a shop playing with
traditional flavors.

00:04:40.165 --> 00:04:42.748
(upbeat music)

00:05:34.569 --> 00:05:37.152
(lively music)

